<mxCell id="n27" value="&lt;b&gt;Reject&lt;/b&gt; (…/reject/): task rejected, Approval rejected, other open tasks terminated; create → object soft-deleted, update → original_data restored, delete → object stays active.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Override&lt;/b&gt; (/api/approval/override/&amp;lt;uuid&amp;gt;/): an overrider completes the whole approval at once." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bfa900;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1520" y="1204" width="320" height="116" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
